    {
      "number": 26,
      "text": "Or like a downpour from the sky accompanied by darkness, thunder, and lightning. They put their fingers into their ears out of thunderclaps, for fear of death. But Allah encompasses the disbelievers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 2,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَقَرَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Baqara",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cow",
