      "ruku": 3,
      "hizbQuarter": 1,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 27,
      "text": "The lightning almost snatches away their eyesight. Every time lightning[13] strikes, they walk in its light, but when it becomes dark, they stand still. If Allah had willed, He would have taken away their hearing and their sight; for Allah is Most Capable of all things.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 2,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَقَرَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Baqara",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cow",
